  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support 20 disabled young women for tailoring</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young women with Disabilities in our community face sexual reproductive health challenges of which some are exacerbated by the effects of COVID 19. The project will support 20 Young disabled women with modern commercial tailoring. Products will be sold off to the community members because there is available market. The project will provide sewing machines  and materials for making tailoring</narrative>
  </description>
